{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p>12月1日下午，深圳市民<span lang=\"zh\">李</span>先生收到了由京东物流小哥<span lang=\"zh\">送达的</span>快递包裹，<strong>这也是2025年中国第1800亿件快递包裹</strong>，标志着全国快递业务量再次创下新纪录。</p>\n<p>这一快递<span lang=\"zh\">包裹由前沿物流科技生产并履约，</span>李先生下单后，<strong><span lang=\"zh\">商品经由</span>京东物流深圳中小件智狼仓、<span lang=\"zh\">智能</span>分拣中心进行快速分拣出库，在末端由京东物流独狼<span lang=\"zh\">无人车</span>进行接驳运输，在京东物流超脑2.0最优路区规划下快速送达，京东小哥完成送货上门</strong>。2025年的这1800亿订单不仅展现了京东超级供应链的物流科技实力，更显示了我国物流行业高质量发展中的科技化、智能化在加速推进。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1764589038721.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">△京东小哥给深圳市民李先生配送今年第1800亿件快递</span></p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;MsoNormal&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">&ldquo;智狼&rdquo;仓机器人出库</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;MsoNormal&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">无人车接驳</span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p>收到第1800亿件快递包裹的李先生说，自己在京东APP上给儿子下单了一台AI智能学习机，&ldquo;因为京东快递在我们这里足够快，没想到自己成了幸运儿，见证了中国快递物流行业的高光时刻！&rdquo;</p>\n<p>在李先生所在的小区，京东物流<span lang=\"zh\">&ldquo;</span>独狼<span lang=\"zh\">&rdquo;第六代</span>无人车常年进行社区快递配送服务，<span lang=\"zh\">无人车</span>与京东快递小哥组成了人车CP，<span lang=\"zh\">当</span>快递包裹到达末端站点后<span lang=\"zh\">，</span>将被进一步分拣并装入<span lang=\"zh\">无人</span>车，并独自运输至小区门口<span lang=\"zh\">，</span>京东快递小哥只需在门口理货并送货上门即可。京东快递小哥张繁长期服务这一小区，&ldquo;自从有了这个工作&lsquo;搭子&rsquo;，我能够专注地在小区进行揽收和派送，节省了不少往返时间，揽派量也提升了不少&rdquo;。<strong>如今在深圳，京东物流无人车配送规模位居行业前列</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1764589107061.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">△京东物流第六代无人车将快递运输给送货上门的快递员</span></p>\n<p>而在<strong>第1800亿件快递包裹产生地&mdash;&mdash;京东物流深圳智狼仓</strong>中，近200台智狼搬运机器人和飞梯机器人，以及高密度货架、定制化料箱、自动入库工作站等构成了庞大的&ldquo;智狼货到人系统&rdquo;，可<span lang=\"zh\">在存储、搬运和</span>拣选等<span lang=\"zh\">环节实现自动化操作</span>，实现生产效率的大幅提升。&ldquo;智狼&rdquo;等多种物流前沿设备的投入也让京东物流多了&ldquo;智慧仓运维员&rdquo;、&ldquo;无人车运维员&rdquo;、&ldquo;飞手&rdquo;等诸多一线岗位，李锦源是京东物流首批招聘的智慧仓运维员之一，负责机器人日常的维护和检修。<span lang=\"zh\">在这里</span>他每天可以见证超4万件包裹发出，<span lang=\"zh\">他</span>说：&ldquo;智狼设备的应用大大提升了我们的处理效率，例如刚刚产生的第1800亿件快递包裹，从收到订单到出库，最快15分钟就可以完成。&rdquo;</p>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span data-pm-slice=\"2 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;MsoNormal&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">超脑2.0+狼族机器人</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;MsoNormal&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">助力打造京东超级供应链</span></strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section>\n<section>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p>第1800亿件快递的高效履约，背后是京东物流全链路科技实力的全面支撑。如今，京东物流通过&ldquo;超脑2.0+狼族机器人&rdquo;智能体系实现全流程AI驱动，其中，京东物流&ldquo;超脑&rdquo;大模型2.0作为&ldquo;智慧指挥官&rdquo;，可将亿级包裹的仿真推演时间缩短至3分钟内，并结合针对千万级别变量的模型加速技术，动态调整物流最优规划，通过数字孪生实时监控全链路，目前已应用于上百个场景。</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">而在</span>仓储环节中，<span lang=\"zh\">京东物流</span>&ldquo;狼族&rdquo;系列机器人覆盖存储、拣选、搬运、分拣等全场景。如今，<strong>&ldquo;智狼&rdquo;机器人仓<span lang=\"zh\">已</span>创下全球累计出库单量第一的纪录，入库上架效率提升6倍，出库拣选效率提升3倍，准确率达99.99%</strong>；&ldquo;异狼&rdquo;机械臂抓取量持续突破峰值；无人车接驳次数同比增长超6倍。</p>\n<p><strong data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;sl-paragraph&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: center;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;7 2 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1764589204631.jpg\" /></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">△今年第1800亿件快递包裹从京东物流深圳地狼仓发出</span></p>\n<p>京东物流相关负责人表示，京东物流将加速推进人工智能、机器人等在物流行业的应用，构建京东超级供应链的强大底座，并通过科技驱动，助力降低全社会物流成本，为我们合作伙伴高质量发展添砖加瓦。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mkt.getwuce.jdl.com/mF/commonLandingPage/CTA/c1bfb8a568a849c39f69d57aae0fa3d7?pushId=BmfX2esVQJ3ESdHY7Whevd1\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1764589661194.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02997", "contentTitle": "今年第1800亿件快递由京东物流妥投！智狼分拣、“人机CP”送达", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1764589734000, "id": 6841, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1764589730595.jpg", "updateTime": 1764679741000}}